Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:59.90,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}大廈林立 人潮湧動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.14,0:19:06.88,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}舞台之上 思緒紛繁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:45.87,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}過了九點 我幡然醒悟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:52.74,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}在黑暗中 揉揉惺忪的雙眼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:20:00.84,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}請來這邊 極目遠眺
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:06.07,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}光芒數量有所增加
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:13.45,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}但面目全非的自己卻被留在原地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:22.73,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}這是多麼孤單啊 你同情地哭道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:56.65,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}大廈林立 人潮湧動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:03.75,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}舞台之上 思緒紛繁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:13.63,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}{\fscx100\t(1360,1660,0,\fscx0)}大廈林立{\fscx0\t(1360,1660,0,\fscx100)}抖擻精神 閉目凝息{\fscx100\t(1360,1660,0,\fscx0)}人潮湧動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:20.79,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}在你奔跑的雙腳下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:27.50,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}{\fscx100\t(1320,1620,0,\fscx0)}舞台之上{\fscx0\t(1320,1620,0,\fscx100)}無限延展開去{\fscx100\t(1320,1620,0,\fscx0)}思緒紛繁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.05,0:21:35.08,chs-オーバー,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}灑滿光芒的大道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:10.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎 早上了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼你會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:19.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然是 來叫你起床的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:53.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我老爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 我來的時候他好像不在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:00.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不好意思啊 還要你幫我做飯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:06.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要道歉的人是我 如果我能多注意一些就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.39,0:02:07.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別說啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:11.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 你可是代替我被停學的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:13.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說實話 我直到現在還在猶豫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:18.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是應該馬上趕到教員室 向他們說明真相
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.94,0:02:20.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千萬不要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:25.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是說過嗎 無論如何都要讓你成為學生會長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是為了演劇部吧 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:31.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:33.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以的話 請一起來品嚐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:40.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可真是難得啊 好久沒有吃過這樣的早餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:44.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君 我就坐你旁邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我吃飽了 味道很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原 快起來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幹什麼嘛 一大早的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.93,0:03:14.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有女孩子來向你進行愛的告白了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:15.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:22.88,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那是什麼打扮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:24.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}橄欖球部的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:24.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咦 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:25.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是內衣小偷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且連男人的都不放過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:28.77,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:30.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這死變態
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:33.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶然真是恐怖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:36.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做這種事很開心？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:37.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:40.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就當作是代替了鬧鐘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:43.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反而弄得我差點失去意識了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:47.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我差不多要去學校了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你打算一直待在這兒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 幫我和杏她們打聲招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:56.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然代替坂上同學被停學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是不得要領啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒什麼事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:05.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}會不會影響到升學以及就業
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:07.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常擔心的說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:11.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}部長病假 朋也停學
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣子我們真的還能參加學園祭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經三天了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:28.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我為什麼會總想著那傢伙的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:34.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喲 我們來看你了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:37.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是難為你了啊 岡崎君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 什麼啊 原來是你們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼嘛 你以為是誰來了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:48.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說回來啊 你不是被停學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:49.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不待在家裡可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:52.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣說著卻把我帶出來玩的又是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:54.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐 要去哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:56.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:00.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挺有氣氛的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:03.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}請輸入雙方的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:02.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}占卜遊戲的話 椋也能盡興的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 輸入名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:09.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是用這個啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:12.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是男方的標誌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:19.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兩 兩人的關係？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算是這麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:22.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:24.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 必須要合作才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是寫了要兩人的手一起嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.63,0:05:32.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 不 我無所謂的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:35.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:40.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 你在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:45.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:49.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好痛啊 杏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:52.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還 還不是因為你做出這種破壞氣氛的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這種時候啊 一般都是選擇戀人什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:57.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把氣氛搞起來才對的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}溫柔的女性與富有責任感的男性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:04.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作為朋友的相性非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:08.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能否進一步發展就要看兩人的想法了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:11.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總覺得是個模稜兩可的解答呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:14.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}占卜不就是那樣的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:18.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過 沒有被說相性最差之類的話真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:22.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我還有事 就先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:24.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也 記得把椋送回家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:30.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你還真是喜歡那些東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:34.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女孩子可是擁有喜歡占卜的遺傳基因哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過 你倒是很少說中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:38.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:41.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是呢 我一直都說不中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:43.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經有自知之明了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:46.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然了 雖然說不中的話會感到有些遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:49.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我覺得那樣其實也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:51.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:58.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果占卜說中了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:01.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不就意味著未來只有一種可能性了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果說不中的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.37,0:07:07.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就會讓人覺得未來還有許許多多的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:12.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一個小小的契機 就能讓未來發生未知的改變
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:16.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望在我們接下來所走的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:19.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能充滿各種各樣的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:29.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}週日就不用過來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:31.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就讓我做到心滿意足為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:33.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我老爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剛才出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和你父親相處得不好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:44.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我不該刨根問底的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:49.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}選舉怎麼樣了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}馬上就該投票了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:55.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很順利 不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:08:00.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 給你帶慰勞品來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:02.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 姐姐非要這樣做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:09.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:10.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有客人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:11.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:12.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:16.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小杏 小椋 早上好的說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:19.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼連小琴美也來了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:23.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我為朋也君做了料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:26.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想一個人會餓肚子的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:36.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空氣好像很沉重呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:40.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這麼多…可能…吃不完…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:43.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可是我和椋五點就起來做的料理哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:45.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定會吃掉的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:49.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是要為岡崎受停學處分負責任的相關人員
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:50.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有照顧日常生活的義務
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相關人員這什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:54.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像我們是毫不相關的人似的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:56.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明確地說就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:59.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我認為這件事和你們沒有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們可是從二年級開始就認識了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:04.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且同為演劇部的部員
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:07.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人與人的交往不能與時間和地位掛鈎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:12.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你們 不要那樣生氣也…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:14.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因為你優柔寡斷才會這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.66,0:09:16.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算這樣說我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藤林 你也幫我說句話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:23.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也…我也希望你能吃我做的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:29.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琴美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:32.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琴美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:37.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是從昨晚開始準備 很努力地做的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子 登 場
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:44.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:47.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子也帶親手做好的料理來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:49.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎 這裡就請交給風子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:51.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 真的不要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:54.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我了解大家的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:58.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是岡崎應該選擇風子的料理才行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:09:59.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海星年輪蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:01.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海星蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海星奶油派
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好噁心的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:09.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎君 請品嚐一下我的便當吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:11.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也請品嚐一下我的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:13.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不快點吃的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:14.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}後果知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:20.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最佳選擇哦 岡崎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:23.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最佳 選擇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:27.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您工作辛苦了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:35.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別嚷 昨天吃的太多了 胃痛得厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:39.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊 還像那樣悠閒沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人家智代出了這麼大的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:43.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽說來這之前可是很厲害的不良少女
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.86,0:10:49.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前還有別的學校的人在放學後找上門來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.26,0:10:51.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是岡崎做的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:52.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:55.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小聲點 他本人就在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:56.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是這麼一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:10:58.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}準備怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.07,0:11:03.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼 一決勝負？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:08.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 如果我們輸了的話 撿球什麼的隨你使喚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:12.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍微等下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:13.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和大家商量一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:17.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣做就能改善形象嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:19.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籃球比賽的活用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:20.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定會順利的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:24.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只玩過投接球哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:29.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒關係 我們擁有春原這個天才運動員
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:30.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更加擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:34.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有一個條件
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:41.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你們輸了 坂上必須參加女子壘球部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:47.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:57.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}智代 只要三人出局我們就贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:00.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但只要有人上壘的話 我們就輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我會想辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.73,0:12:04.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:11.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:19.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}給我閉嘴 會分心的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:23.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這裡打出四壞保送的話 一輩子叫你膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:25.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這高射炮投手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:26.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷靜點 智代
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.09,0:12:29.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原太讓人生氣了 無法集中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:32.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣的話 對著春原的臉使勁投
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:34.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱著把那傢伙打飛的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.76,0:12:37.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的臉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}高射炮投手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 我試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來吧 膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:53.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好球！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.73,0:13:05.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好球 擊球手出局！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:06.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真爽快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:08.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們贏啦 智代
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:12.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽說了嗎 二年級的坂上智代
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:15.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和棒球部比賽竟然贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好厲害 不愧是智代前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要去看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:22.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:30.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多虧了你 流言蜚語都煙消雲散了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:31.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:34.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事 這也是為了演劇部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:36.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也要感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:38.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣的話 目標可能很快就能實現了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:40.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目標？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:43.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對了 還沒有跟你說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:49.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想保留下這片櫻花樹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:52.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為有個採伐計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:54.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道的學生都說太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.11,0:13:56.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}居住在附近的人也很反對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:14:00.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要當上這所學校的學生會會長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:03.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可以為保留下這片櫻花樹而做出貢獻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:07.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你難道是為了這個特意轉校過來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:08.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:13.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無論如何我也想把這裡保留下來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:16.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這裡是十分重要的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎以前是什麼樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:25.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼樣的 也沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:28.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前過得很頹廢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:31.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}頹廢的理由 不…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:35.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你覺得對大多數人來說 是什麼能讓他不會頹廢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概是才能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:42.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有才能的話 就可以明確自己想做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:44.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後專注地去做就是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:45.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高明的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:48.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果沒有才能的話怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:51.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戀愛之類的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:52.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:54.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也是一個不錯的答案呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.05,0:14:58.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找到的答案是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:14:58.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:02.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}擁有家人的話 人便可以自律
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也不一定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:07.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也有人因為家人而變得一團糟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:10.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說的家人 不一定非是真正意義上的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙伴也是可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:16.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要是像家人一樣的存在就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:18.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我並不想強求別人同意我的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:21.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但這是我自己的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:26.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父母關係很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:29.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家裡冷冷清清的 沒有對話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:31.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就連架都不會吵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並不是哪一方的不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:38.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那些瑣碎的誤解和不滿不斷積累起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.32,0:15:41.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在不經不覺中使家人變得形同陌路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:45.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直過得很頹廢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:49.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把怒氣和急躁發洩在別人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:52.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一個很脆弱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:59.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使這樣的我醒悟的人是 我弟弟鷹文
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:04.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是個老實乖巧 非常溫柔的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:08.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我卻不是一個好姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:13.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從未見到過他的笑臉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:19.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兩年前 父母離婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:24.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了孩子的撫養權而吵個不停
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.12,0:16:28.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我抱著完全無所謂的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.89,0:16:31.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是鷹文卻說不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:33.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他說無論歸誰都不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他還是第一次像那樣說話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:42.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跳河了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:47.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他說如果父母離婚的話自己就跳下去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:49.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後就真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼要這樣做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:56.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他並不是想尋死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:17:00.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理由大概連他自己都不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是 由於他的舉動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:07.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使我們第一次真正地成為了一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:13.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個我本以為已經冷淡得無藥可救了的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.44,0:17:22.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到了春天 和終於能夠出院的弟弟一起走過了這條路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:24.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弟弟這樣說道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:29.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「以後每年都要和家人來看這裡的櫻花」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:36.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和父母都是一樣的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:45.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小鎮在改變
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:50.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但仍舊有很多人重視著這片櫻花樹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:55.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不只是我 住在這個小鎮裡的許多人都是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無論看上去是多麼冷淡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:01.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重視的心情並未改變
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:06.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想家人之間也是這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚 歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:16.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的好久不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:18.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恢復精神真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:20.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓你們擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:23.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:25.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什 什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:32.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽說你為了使坂上同學當上學生會長而被停學了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:35.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我該怎麼道歉才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:39.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用了 這並不是為了你一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:41.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是為了整個演劇部而做的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感覺被你這麼一說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:46.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像欠了你一個恩情似的很不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:49.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是這個意思 總之這件事已經過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:51.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果想要負起責任來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:53.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就幫忙一下放學後智代的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:54.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:18:58.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一局定勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我贏了的話 你就要加入網球部哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:03.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了 請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:07.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對手也是女生就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:10.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坂上同學 沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:15.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來了不少人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:17.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:19.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 就是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:23.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.69,0:19:27.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比賽已經開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:35.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到目前為止狀態都很好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:37.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}接下來要交換場地嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:38.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:36.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坂上同學 你要喝點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在不用 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:45.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們之前有見過吧 你是叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:47.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫古河渚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:49.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要建立演劇部
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:50.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演劇部？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:55.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原來如此 是這麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:58.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 沒什麼 我上了
